  "description": "In complete Wilier style, we have also applied the pleasure of assisted pedalling to our all-round bike dedicated to all those who love a road bike without too much effort. The comfort-focused geometries are available in five frame sizes: XS, S, M, L, XL.\n\nThe result is an e-road bike with a clean-cut design featuring fully integrated cable routing that has inherited the shapes of the sports version to the point of being mistaken for it at first glance. The Garda Hybrid uses the proven and reliable Mahle X35+ drive unit with 250 Wh motor inserted in the rear hub while the battery is housed in the down tube.\n\nThat impossible climb is no longer an obstacle. Instead, it has become a genuine launch pad. A new perspective, a new way to see the world and discover, or rediscover, a new dimension: the pleasure of stress-free pedalling.",
